yout from the Catholic Church, marking one of the largest clergy abuse settlements in the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nigeria: Tinubu launches reelection bid amid economic woes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d81126e748eb2531379da149f1115061550ba450f975be0eb8775acce982469a</id><updated>2026-10-25T04:58:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-24T23:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nigeria-tinubu-launches-reelection-bid-amid-economic-woes/a-79753063--a627d82d207b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-tinubu-launches-reelection-bid-amid-economic-woes/a-79753063?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">President Bola Tinubu promised "a better tomorrow" for Nigerians while kicking off his next electoral campaign, while also blaming his rivals for poverty plaguing Africa's most populous nation.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine: Starlink satellite speeds restored to normal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c11d4a5eecebf849f63cfc2e66585c2551d855a391138cb04ebbe072082ae61a</id><updated>2026-10-25T04:58:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-24T19:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-starlink-satellite-speeds-restored-to-normal/a-79752155--bc405a2647f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-starlink-satellite-speeds-restored-to-normal/a-79752155?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The announcement comes after Starlink and Starshield restrictions had disrupted military operations in Ukraine and sparked tensions with the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German national facing trial for alleged attempt to join IS</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9305da1c1de2999b747d21ba17c9562b6025499a817b33b08bbe30263c7897f1</id><updated>2026-10-25T04:57:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-24T15:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../.