king 2026 one of the long war's bloodiest years for Kyiv. DW asked people on the ground what life is like.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Jordan: Karak church shooting leaves 7 dead, dozens injured</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:28d83f4b35487cca3cdd916597beb082b5f33bb0f6fdeb355a9568fee40b2b64</id><updated>2026-10-25T04:57:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T18:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/jordan-karak-church-shooting-leaves-7-dead-dozens-injured/a-79743535--fb132a258471.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/jordan-karak-church-shooting-leaves-7-dead-dozens-injured/a-79743535?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A shooting at a Greek Orthodox church in southern Jordan happened during a funeral, according to authorities. Two unidentified men opened fire on the procession, with Jordan's king vowing "the harshest retaliation."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia, Ukraine agree to US-brokered, 1 city ceasefire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e68967da1a8b70603330df4f8decde4f75a5cec0f83d7943a0956ceb2a9f00bd</id><updated>2026-10-25T04:57:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T18:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-agree-to-us-brokered-1-city-ceasefire/a-79746723--d5b21a176374.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-ukraine-agree-to-us-brokered-1-city-ceasefire/a-79746723?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Ukrainian city of Oleshky, occupied by Russia and on the frontline, faces a humanitarian crisis. The localized truce comes as Ukrainian President Zelenskyy said negotiators would meet for wider talks next month.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
